### Create a new incident (AI will score it as HIGH because of "database" and "down")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Database server is down",
    "description": "Cannot connect to MySQL database, users are unable to login"
}
### Get all incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
### Create a LOW severity incident
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Need help with password reset",
    "description": "User forgot their password, can't login to portal"
}
### Update to IN_PROGRESS
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/incidents/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
### Create a LOW severity incident
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Typo on homepage footer",
    "description": "There is a spelling mistake in the copyright text"
}
### What severity will this get?
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Security breach! Customer data exposed",
    "description": "Unauthorized access detected, sensitive customer information may have been leaked"
}
### Get all incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/incidents